WEBVTT

00:03:28.954 --> 00:03:33.079
By then, Barry was in his 20s watching
his father's business decline.

00:03:33.663 --> 00:03:35.496
It was slow and painful.

00:03:35.746 --> 00:03:39.454
He refused to give up. And
so he kept putting more

00:03:39.454 --> 00:03:41.496
and more of his own personal money into

00:03:41.496 --> 00:03:45.538
the business until finally he had
no more personal money left

00:03:45.871 --> 00:03:48.121
and it ended up closing up.

00:03:48.496 --> 00:03:54.788
So that was something that was really
indelibly engraved in my psyche.

00:03:55.079 --> 00:03:57.371
Fast forward a few years
and Barry was watching

00:03:57.371 --> 00:03:59.871
the American government fall
into the same trap.

00:03:59.996 --> 00:04:04.329
It dawned on me that the Vietnam War was
very similar to my father's experience,